              "title": "A lighthouse keeper's grandfather",
              "text": "When the Everstorm came, Puuli, a Natan lighthouse keeper, wondered if this was the time his grandfather had warned of: a time of change, when men from a hidden island of the Origin would at last come to take back Natanatan."
