              "title": "New Natanan carries on",
              "text": "The city-state of New Natanan, on Roshar's far eastern coast, is all that is left of the Natan government, with a few smaller settlements as its protectorates. It took part in Dalinar's talks at Urithiru on an alliance against the Voidbringers, but the Natans care most about winning back their homeland and its Oathgate.",
